window.products.push({"id":1053010,"name":"The Art of Craft Boston Shaker Set: Two Piece 18oz and 28oz Weighted Stainless Steel Professional Bartender Cocktail Shaker Tins","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WX1QbRthS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROFESSIONAL QUALITY: Made from rustproof and leakproof 304 food-grade stainless steel. DEPENDABLE: The 18 oz. and 28 oz. weighted tins give you the ideal shake every time. Constructed to fit together perfectly giving you a watertight seal that won’t freeze shut or break like other shakers. EASY to USE/ EASY to CLEAN: Precise pouring, no drips or spills. Dishwasher safe so cleaning is a breeze. ENDLESS POSSIBILITIES: Make your favorite shaken drinks like Margaritas, Whiskey Sours and Daiquiris. The larger tin can also be used to prepare stirred drinks like, Martinis, Manhattans and Negronis. Great for mocktails as well! ONE SHAKER FITS ALL: Ideal for professional bartenders and home bar enthusiast alike.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WX1QbRthS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THE ART OF CRAFT","source_asin":"B097CF88YG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1053010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097CF88YG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097CF88YG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1053011,"name":"Witch Ball Arcola by Iron Art Glass Designs (4 Inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pxO6wzp1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Witch Balls are hand blown glass spheres, with 3 to 5 strands inside for collecting evil spirits and the like. Each one is unique with color, strands, bubbles, and size. Our glass art Witch Balls begin as clear recycled glass. As the molten hot glass is formed, color glass granules are applied to color 70% to 90% of surface, and to create the design pattern. Leaving clear areas allows sunlight the to brighten the sphere and the strands inside the ball. Each Witch Ball is handcrafted unique, no two are exactly the same. Witch Balls tend to be heavier than a regular ball, and can have a irregular surface from the formation of the strands inside. Color patterns and saturation vary from piece to piece as one would expect from a completely handmade art object. The size is about that of a apple, 4\" diameter (the distance across). These balls are sealed, and will work well as pond floats. Let the magic of our glass artists protect your home. Iron Elegance does its best to provide accurate product details on Amazon. Displayed digital images have the most accurate representation possible. There may be slight differences in color from the image on screen and color of the product you receive due to the user’s screen settings, photo lighting, surfaces photographed on, time of day the photo was taken, and filters applied. Amazon requires items to be imaged on a bright white background. Glass color can look different from natural light to artificial light. When a sphere is presented as a flat image, the camera sees color from both sides of the sphere. Consumer Safety- Our glass ornaments do not represent a safety risk. However, glassware is fragile. If using it beyond the item’s ornamental intent, breakages can occur and broken glass is an injury hazard. Caution should be taken opening of the product package, handling, hanging, and accessibility to children limited. Ornaments are not intended to be worn, nor rubbed on skin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pxO6wzp1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iron Elegance","source_asin":"B079WKVCVZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1053011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079WKVCVZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079WKVCVZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
