window.products.push({"id":1053220,"name":"RNK Shops Fall Leaves Tissue Box Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cvz1RyzzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spruce up any ordinary tissue box in your home with one of our tissue box covers! These square tissue box covers are ideal for adding subtle touches of décor to your home, while still serving a functional purpose! Customize a few for a bathroom, childs bedroom, or living room! You can easily customize one of these tissue box covers to match your rooms existing décor, or you can decorate it with bold patterns and let it serve as a statement accent piece!These tissue holders are built from durable acrylic and display your unique personalization on fine-quality vinyl inserts placed within the four sides and top. The box features two pieces, allowing you to easily switch out tissue boxes. On the sides, youll find ridges that ensure the top and base fit securely in place. The bottom of these tissue box holders has four, rubber, non-slip pads to prevent the box from scuffing any surface you decide to display it on. Each box can fit a standard 5 by 5-inch box of tissues.To insert or remove a tissue box from this decorative tissue box holder, simply pull the top part away from the bottom by holding onto the openings on the top and bottom of the box. Once the box is open, place your tissue box inside the bottom piece and slide the top half of the box over it until the two pieces click back into place. Simply wipe down this tissue holder with warm water to dust and clean.Design Shown: Fall Leaves (#513912)Features:==================================== * [Durable Material]: Crafted from sturdy acrylic with fine-quality vinyl inserts. * [Functional Design]: Two-piece construction for easy insertion and removal of tissue boxes. * [Non-slip Base]: Four rubber pads on the bottom prevent scuffing and ensure stability. * [Fits Standard Tissue Boxes]: Designed to accommodate standard 5\" x 5\" tissue boxes seamlessly.Assembly Instructions:==================================== * Hold onto openings on top and bottom to pull top away from base * Insert or remove tissue box from base * Slide top back over the base until the pieces click togetherCare Instructions:==================================== * To clean wipe outside of box with cloth using water or mild detergent","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cvz1RyzzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B0181W0KKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1053220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0181W0KKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0181W0KKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
