window.products.push({"id":1053241,"name":"3PCS St Patricks Day Decorations Shamrock Table Centerpieces + 3PCS Green String Lights - Saint Pattys Signs Irish Party Decor Ornaments (Assembly Nee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ePqhWEieL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3PCS lighted shamrock table centerpieces - 6pcs shamrock-shaped plastic corrugated boards in 3 designs to make 3 table centerpieces + 18pcs white fasteners + 3pcs hemp ropes + 3pcs green light strings with battery box (Battery Not Included). Multiple sizes - The cute lucky clover table decorations set includes three sizes, the large size is about 5.8”*5.3”, the medium size is about 4.6”*4.2”, and the small size is about 3.8”*3.5”. When you insert the battery box into the ornament, the thickness of finished is 1 inch. It can meet your different St Patricks Day decorations needs. Assembly instructions - Insert white fastener into the holes of a board, do the same on the another board. Press the fastener one-to-one to put two boards together. (Note: Don't press two fastener too tight at first). Place the string of light in the middle of the two boards. The light strip can be directly placed or untied and freely wrapped around the fastener. Turn on the light, you will get the light up lucky clover ornament. St patricks day decorations for the home - The freestanding lighted shamrock table centerpieces can be conveniently placed on tables, desktops, desks, bookshelves, mantels, cabinets or other places. You can also use hemp rope to hang on walls, doors, etc., to create a strong festive atmosphere at home. St patricks day gifts - The little lucky clover ornaments can be used not only as home decorations but also as gifts for family and friends, symbolizing hope and blessings on this st patricks day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ePqhWEieL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tieshankao","source_asin":"B09MVJYHKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1053241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MVJYHKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MVJYHKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1053242,"name":"Oster CKSTSKRM20 16-Inch Removable Pan Electric Skillet, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4182EuhLsOL._AC_.jpg","description":"Equipped with an extra-large 12 by 16-inch cooking surface, this versatile Oster electric skillet comes in handy for large families or when cooking for a crowd, especially during the holidays. Use it for frying, sautéing, baking, and roasting anything from pancakes, eggs, French toast, bacon, or sausage links to veggie burgers, steaks, pork chops, and more. The unit's front-mounted temperature-control dial ranges from 150 to 400 degrees F, while its keep-warm setting keeps food at an ideal serving temperature without overcooking. For added convenience, the uniquely designed unit features a removable Cook 'n Serve skillet pan, which makes it possible to cook and serve all in the same skillet-no need to dirty extra dishes. The skillet pan can be removed from the heating base and placed in the oven for baking or roasting, but be sure to remove the lid first as it's not oven-safe. When using the Oster skillet as a serving piece, place it on a 3/8-inch-high trivet to protect tabletop surfaces. The skillet comes with a nonstick interior and exterior, which allows for lower-fat cooking (no need for excess butter or oil), effortless food release, and quick cleanup by hand or in the dishwasher. Other highlights include a power indicator light; cool-touch side handles with soft grips for safe, secure transport; and a full-view tempered-glass lid with an adjustable steam vent that makes it easy to monitor cooking food at a glance. This electric skillet carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4182EuhLsOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oster","source_asin":"B00451B83S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1053242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00451B83S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00451B83S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
