window.products.push({"id":1053459,"name":"Scratch Off World Map by Kitval Maps: Detailed Scratchable Travel Journal Poster with US States and Country Flags – Unique Wall Decoration for Travele","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wAEK851dL._AC_.jpg","description":"Are You Addicted To Traveling? This scratch off world map poster is a musthave piece for anyone who loves traveling and anyone who wishes to explore as many countries as possible! Take a look at the pictures of the scratchable map – the countries of all continents and the states of America, Canada and Australia are all outlined with precision. This detailed black and gold world map is 32.5 x 23.4 inches large, and can be scratched and reveal the most beautiful and bright colors! The Most Elegant Wall Decoration For Your House And Office! Kitval Maps has designed a unique conversation starter and the most elegant way to show off your adventures! The scratch-off map poster has the most beautiful colors and detailed design, and it will look great in your house or office. What’s Included In This Amazing Wanderlust Bundle? Apart from the stunning scratch-off map poster, the bundle also includes some practical and adorable accessories: Guitar Pick Scratcher (random color, can be red, blue, white or black) Memory Stickers (to mark your travel memories) Flag Pins (to mark special places and future trips) Soft Cloth (to clean the scratched map) Luxury Storage Bag (to keep the accessories clean and safe) The Ultimate Gift For Travel Enthusiasts! Do you know someone who loves traveling? Then give them the scratch off map as a gift and watch their face light up as they unfold it! The entire scratchable world poster set comes in the most beautiful packaging, so it is ready to be handed to a traveler as a gift! Don’t Waste Another Minute! Scroll Up And Click The “Add to Cart” Button NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wAEK851dL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitval Maps","source_asin":"B07834M46D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1053459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07834M46D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07834M46D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
