window.products.push({"id":1053772,"name":"SimpleKitchen Oil Sprayer for Cooking, 200ml Glass Olive Oil Sprayer Mister, Olive Oil Spray Bottle, Kitchen Gadgets for Air Fryer, Canola Oil Spritze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tOYn5WZ3L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Food Grade and Eco-Friendly: The Olive Sprayer is made from food grade material. It is safe and odor-free. It can be directly filled with edible oil and used, making it an eco-friendly option that reduces your carbon footprint. A Versatile Kitchen Tool: The Multipurpose Oil Sprayer Bottle is a versatile kitchen tool that can be used for a variety of cooking methods, such as frying, grilling, baking, and air frying. Its atomized spraying of cooking oil is hygienic, convenient, and fuel-efficient, making it a beloved helper among chefs and gourmets alike. Precise and Convenient: With the Effective Control of Oil Flow, each trigger pull delivers a precise ¼ teaspoon (1.5g) of oil, giving you total control over calorie counting in your kitchen, regardless of which oil you use. Lightweight and Easy to Carry: The Portable To Carry Oil Sprayer Bottle is lightweight (0.2lb weight and 200ml capacity), making it suitable for use in the kitchen or on-the-go. You can fill it with your preferred oil and take it with you wherever you go. Ensuring Even Coating: It is important to swing over the area you wish to spray with the Oil Sprayer Bottle, starting the swing before pulling the trigger and releasing the trigger before stopping the swing. Failure to do so may result in uneven oil coating and oil buildup in stagnant areas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tOYn5WZ3L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SimpleKitchen","source_asin":"B0BXGSM93F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1053772","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXGSM93F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXGSM93F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
