window.products.push({"id":1053781,"name":"Nucookery Butter Dish, Large Ceramic Butter Dishes with Covers, Covered Butter Container with Bamboo Lid for Countertop, Deluxe Butter Holder for East","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eXgveiFnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【DEEP AND WIDE DESIGND FOR DAILY USE】 The dark blue large butter dish measures（include the lid) 6.7\"x 4\"x 3.4\" which is wide and deep enough to fit a wide range of shaped sticks of butter. The tall and deep design helps stop the butter from sticking to the top of the lid. The butter dish with cover works great fit for hold STANDARD sticks of butter. Works perfectly for both WEST and EAST/EUROPEAN coast butter. The butter dish with bamboo lid also fit for Kerrygold, Land O'Lakes and more. ❤【FINEST QUALITY CRAFTSMANSHIP】 This butter container is more beautiful and safe than the plastic. The covered butter dish countertop is made with premium quality, highly durable food-grade materials, a unique combination of ceramic, natural wooden lid and silicone seal on the edge, being easy to wash and guaranteed to withstand the test of time. ❤【KEEP YOUR BUTTER FRESH】Say goodbye to wasted product and enjoy the superior flavor of your favorite butter with this butter dish with bamboo lid which creates an airtight seal and prevents unwanted odors from altering the content. This butter dish with lid for countertop also provides a natural style for your kitchen. Very elegant! ❤【NOT JUST A BUTTER CONTAINER】The bamboo lid of the french butter dish works as a small cutting board for slicing. You could use the lid as a butter cutting board. You can use the butter holder with lid to store sugar, salt, spices, seasoning, and cookie jars; if you are a baking lover, you can use the butter crock for counter to bake your favorite small cake, potato gratin or other desserts. ❤【A MUST IN YOUR KITCHEN & THOUGHTFUL PRESENT】 Would you like to enjoy fresh, creamy butter every morning? The Nucookery ceramic butter dish with lid is exactly what you need! Order the Nucookery butter keeper with lid for yourself or as a thoughtful housewarming present for a friend or loved one, and you can be sure to win their appreciation! An excellent idea also for wedding registry, holiday season, birthday or other special occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eXgveiFnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nucookery","source_asin":"B08SGP4WS3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1053781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SGP4WS3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SGP4WS3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
