window.products.push({"id":1053852,"name":"Newbealer Steam Mop & Detachable Handheld Cleaner, 250ml 1200W Powerful Floor Steamer, 3 Adjustable Levels for Hardwood Laminates Tiles Car, 7 Multi-p","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":86.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6187K7Wr2yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[2 in 1 Steam Mop and Handheld Steamer] The steam mop can be used on any surface you want to clean or you can detach the handheld cleaner to clean blind spots, for the ultimate cleaning experience. 3 Adjustable steam modes allow you to control the intensity of steam being released. [High Temperature & High-Pressure Steam] The 1200W steamer is powerful enough to heat the device in 20 seconds and the temperature can reach up to 248℉, to effectively convert water into steam to blast away dirt, grime, grease, and stains across a variety of indoor and outdoor surfaces and also removes odor. [Lightweight & Convenient] The thin design, durable plastic shell makes for a lightweight steamer so that it can be easily maneuvered. The 180° swivel steer mop head, efficient cleaning mop pads can be used for repeated cleaning and the extended aluminum pole and extra-long power cord of 16 feet allows you to clean hard-to-reach areas quickly and easily. [Functional Water Tank & Multi Usage] The steamer is equipped with a water tank that holds up to 8.5 fl oz/250ml, which lasts up to 10-25 minutes and it works great as a floor steam mop, steam cleaner, carpet cleaner, mirror, glass cleaner, you can also clean your windows, outdoor patio furniture, interior and exterior of autos, many more. [Package Contents] The package includes 1pc handheld pod, 2pc extension pole, 11.6in 1pc mop Head, 2pc washable microfiber pads, 2pc nylon brushes, 1pc brass brush, 1pc squeegee, 1pc triangle brush, 1pc steam jet nozzle, 1pc grout cleaning brush/gap brush, 1pc water fill flask. We offer you a 2-year warranty with professional and friendly customer support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6187K7Wr2yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Newbealer","source_asin":"B0C77YKFR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1053852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C77YKFR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C77YKFR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
