window.products.push({"id":1053981,"name":"Chic 80th Birthday - Pink, Black and Gold - Birthday Gift For Women - Wine Bottle Label Stickers - Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E0bvm5pBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chic 80th Birthday Wine Bottle Gift Set INCLUDES Set of 4 pink, black and gold wine bottle sticker labels in the chic birthday party theme. Wine and liquor bottle stickers each SIZE 4 inches wide x 5 inches tall, perfect for standard 750ml bottles. EASY TO USE: Prepare your beverage bottles by ensuring they are room temperature. Removing the original bottle label is not necessary. Carefully peel one adhesive Chic 80th Birthday - Pink, Black and Gold Wine Bottle Label from the backing and adhere to a bottle, starting at the edge and rolling to the opposite edge. Press down to smooth. HIGH QUALITY BIRTHDAY PARTY SUPPLIES: Chic 80th Birthday - Pink, Black and Gold wine bottle labels are professionally printed on an adhesive paper with a glossy coating. They are waterproof and can be used on bottles that will be chilled, just be sure to apply prior to chilling. Add them to a birthday party beverage bar for an impressive, coordinated display. UNIQUE BIRTHDAY GIFT IDEA: Pink, black and gold Wine Bottle Labels also make a great gift idea. Add Chic 80th Birthday - Pink, Black and Gold Wine Bottle labels to a favorite bottle of wine or spirits for a special birthday gift. Use each wine label on a favorite beverage bottle and gift individually or create an impressive birthday gift basket using all 4 labels on coordinating wine or liquor bottles. Wine bottle labels will easily give your birthday gift a personal touch! MADE IN THE USA: Chic 80th Birthday - Pink, Black and Gold - Wine Bottle Labels are designed and manufactured at our Wisconsin facility using materials that are Made in the USA. Please Note: Wine in image is not included. Chic 80th Birthday Wine Bottle Labels No-Mess Glitter Print: Our beverage labels are designed with a printed image of glitter, eliminating glitter flake while maximizing bling effect!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E0bvm5pBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B01K8NIDS4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1053981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K8NIDS4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K8NIDS4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1053982,"name":"Conair Compact Fabric Steamer, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Av8Kc-teL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Conair, firmly established in the home garment care category with a line of professional steamers, adds another entry – an extremely convenient, compact model. with lots of power – 1200 watts – it’s easy to carry, easy to store, and remarkably easy to manipulate. It smoothes out wrinkles in clothing and in every household fabric – upholstery, drapes, even delicate curtain materials more safely than an iron. What’s more, there are no ‘hot spots’ with steam – it actually helps preserve fabrics. The use of this Compact Fabric Steamer is almost completely hassle-free compared to manipulating an ironing board and iron and the cost saving is major, with fewer dry cleaning bills. It heats up in minutes, provides 20 minutes of steam and comes with snap-on attachments – a lint brush and nylon-bristle brush. There’s even a door hook handle for hanging garments and an integrated carry handle. Thanks to Conair’s innovations, the steamer has become a ‘must have’ for everyone from single households, families, students to corporate workers whose well-groomed days often extend into evening events.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Av8Kc-teL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Conair","source_asin":"B0073A25PS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1053982","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0073A25PS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0073A25PS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
